---
source: crates/langmeld-meta/tests/manifest.rs
expression: "read(\"root = 3\\n[bins]\\nlayout = \\\"many\\\"\\nserver = \\\"calc\\\"\\n\").expect_err(\"wrong\")"
---
error[LM-M004]: `root` must be text in quotes
 --> langmeld.toml:1:8
  |
1 | root = 3
  |        ^
  = note: To fix this, write it as `root = "..."`.

error[LM-M004]: `many` is not a layout of binaries
 --> langmeld.toml:3:10
  |
3 | layout = "many"
  |          ^^^^^^
  = note: To fix this, use `single`, `split` or `multicall`.

error[LM-M004]: `server` must be a list of words
 --> langmeld.toml:4:10
  |
4 | server = "calc"
  |          ^^^^^^
  = note: To fix this, write it as `server = ["mylang", "lsp"]`.
